universal_host_limit: "Two oversized procedure hosts; earlier GSC RSS refusal"
universal_object: "Source-lifted host; 1,911 max labels; object compiled"
declared_procedure_target -> universal_host_limit: numeric and standard objects complete
universal_host_limit -> universal_object: explicit lexical parameters
target_first_link: "Four Make phases linked target"
target_startup: "Target GSI/GSC SIGSEGV; handler ordinal drift; self-emission OPEN"
